WEBVTT

00:17.120 --> 00:22.320
<i>Members of an adventuring party have 
various roles, such as attacker and healer.</i>

00:23.830 --> 00:26.030
<i>I, Rud, am a tank.</i>

00:26.790 --> 00:32.300
<i>The job of the party's tank is to draw all
 enemy attacks and protect the other members.</i>

00:32.300 --> 00:35.090
<i>It's the unsung position 
of powerful adventurers.</i>

00:35.450 --> 00:38.220
<i>This is the story of how 
I turned things around...</i>

00:40.980 --> 00:43.190
<i>and became the protagonist.</i>

00:55.070 --> 01:04.910
<b>The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids</b>

00:55.070 --> 01:04.910
<b>Labyrinth Raids</b>

00:55.070 --> 01:04.910
m 124 277 l 134 267 140 274 144 272 150 275 163 260 177 271 472 271 488 261 502 275 507 270 510 274 518 267 528 277 516 288 526 298 517 306 510 299 506 304 500 299 489 312 473 302 178 302 163 313 150 300 146 303 140 299 134 306 125 297 134 287

00:55.070 --> 01:04.910
A Tank with a Rare 9,999 Resistance Skill 
Got Kicked from the Hero's Party

02:18.490 --> 02:21.120
Oh, dear brother.

02:21.470 --> 02:24.740
I've missed you. I was so lonely.

02:25.200 --> 02:26.880
Manicia!

02:26.880 --> 02:27.830
Rud.

02:27.830 --> 02:30.620
I'll never leave you again!

02:30.620 --> 02:32.020
Rud!

02:32.920 --> 02:36.460
What is it, Nin? 
You're interrupting my joyous fantasy.

02:36.850 --> 02:41.680
Don't give me that crap. Can you stop 
making weird faces while we're at the guild?

02:41.950 --> 02:44.640
Oh, uh... Teehee.

02:44.980 --> 02:48.270
Unbelievable. Were you thinking 
about your little sister again?

02:48.270 --> 02:49.850
How'd you know?

02:49.850 --> 02:52.650
We're in the same party. Of course I'd know.

02:53.160 --> 02:56.350
But, man, you sure do love your sister.

02:56.350 --> 02:58.690
Can't you show an interest
 in something <i>else</i> for once?

02:58.690 --> 02:59.740
Like what?

03:01.110 --> 03:03.620
Like romance, maybe?

03:03.990 --> 03:06.580
What? Nin, you don't mean...

03:06.930 --> 03:08.330
Wait, Rud. You've got the wrong—

03:08.330 --> 03:10.770
But no one's cuter than Manicia.

03:10.770 --> 03:11.460
Bah!

03:12.020 --> 03:14.460
Rud, I'm being serious—

03:14.460 --> 03:16.300
In all seriousness, though...

03:16.950 --> 03:19.510
I'm trying not to think about 
anything else right now.

03:21.200 --> 03:23.550
Manicia has an incurable disease.

03:24.180 --> 03:29.060
My only hope is the Secret Treasure of 
the Labyrinth that is said to grant any wish.

03:29.570 --> 03:30.750
Rud...

03:31.260 --> 03:34.900
But after yesterday's embarrassing display, 
finding it seems impossible.

03:35.670 --> 03:38.140
I'm sorry to the others, too.

03:38.140 --> 03:39.900
Don't say that.

03:40.390 --> 03:42.910
You did your job as a tank.

03:43.610 --> 03:47.760
You didn't even get hit yesterday. It made no 
sense how fast your absorb shield was depleting.

03:47.760 --> 03:49.490
It wasn't just yesterday.

03:49.490 --> 03:54.750
Lately, whenever we enter the labyrinth, 
 my shield's been depleting for some reason.

03:55.350 --> 03:57.750
I consume a lot of potions,

03:57.750 --> 04:01.970
putting a significant burden on you,
 the party's healer. I'm really sorry.

04:01.970 --> 04:03.130
What are you saying?

04:04.610 --> 04:08.730
We've been able to fight as much
 as we have because of you.

04:08.730 --> 04:12.060
I know that you protect me.

04:12.620 --> 04:16.160
Besides, your absorb shield 
has a value of 9,999.

04:16.160 --> 04:18.020
That's the highest value shield ever.

04:18.590 --> 04:19.480
Nin...

04:19.780 --> 04:22.390
You're an exceptional tank.

04:22.390 --> 04:25.230
Even if a new party member 
shows up, hold your head high.

04:25.230 --> 04:26.200
It's the Hero.

04:26.540 --> 04:29.790
The one who's beaten numerous 
labyrinths despite his young age?

04:30.250 --> 04:33.250
That's the great hero Kyglas.

04:35.880 --> 04:37.790
Hey, Rud. Sorry.

04:38.110 --> 04:39.510
Are we late?

04:39.510 --> 04:41.010
No. You're right on time.

04:41.510 --> 04:43.400
Good morning, Lilia and Lily.

04:44.460 --> 04:48.220
Now that the whole party's here,
 let me introduce you.

04:48.220 --> 04:48.800
Come here.

04:49.290 --> 04:51.270
These are our new members.

04:51.750 --> 04:52.270
What?

04:52.270 --> 04:53.730
Hold up, Kyglas.

04:54.010 --> 04:57.930
What's going on here? Labyrinth rules 
only allow parties of up to six people.

04:57.930 --> 04:59.690
This would make us seven.

05:01.080 --> 05:04.400
It's fine. We'll be down to six very soon.

05:05.060 --> 05:07.560
Rud, as of today, you're out.

05:07.560 --> 05:08.220
What?

05:10.150 --> 05:11.080
Why?

05:13.140 --> 05:17.580
Because you're a useless tank.

05:13.850 --> 05:15.580
Wind Blast!

05:15.910 --> 05:17.580
Aqua Storm!

05:18.200 --> 05:19.210
Life...

05:20.420 --> 05:21.690
Burst!

05:23.240 --> 05:24.300
We did it!

05:23.800 --> 05:27.590
Yesterday, you instantly lost 
a significant portion of your shield.

05:27.590 --> 05:29.220
That was the deciding factor.

05:29.960 --> 05:31.220
What's going on?

05:31.690 --> 05:35.140
You can't be serious! We won't make 
any progress with a tank like this.

05:35.140 --> 05:36.350
Uh, but...

05:36.750 --> 05:40.150
Hold it. Rud was blocking the enemy's attacks,

05:40.560 --> 05:42.700
but his absorb shield was still depleting.

05:42.700 --> 05:45.030
There must be some other reason for it.

05:45.030 --> 05:48.550
It's obviously because 
his skills were interfering.

05:48.550 --> 05:51.700
The two skills with unknown effects.

05:49.180 --> 05:50.490
This is bad.

05:50.490 --> 05:51.700
Rud, quickly!

05:57.400 --> 06:00.420
It's true that not all skills are good.

06:00.890 --> 06:04.620
But we still don't know if they're
 the cause. Yet you're just—

06:04.620 --> 06:06.110
What are you talking about?

06:06.110 --> 06:10.720
We could've all been killed. That's more 
than enough reason to kick him out.

06:11.260 --> 06:15.620
Besides, these new members are some of those
 evasion tanks that are popular these days.

06:15.620 --> 06:18.690
They can fight while dodging enemy attacks.

06:19.220 --> 06:22.640
Unlike you, who can only defend.

06:24.570 --> 06:25.780
So in summary...

06:26.320 --> 06:27.990
You're out.

06:41.510 --> 06:42.420
Fine.

06:48.520 --> 06:49.600
Rud...

06:49.600 --> 06:52.340
Hey, I'm not done talking to you.

06:52.780 --> 06:55.890
Yesterday, we made no profit because of you.

06:56.350 --> 06:59.180
Highest shield value ever? Whatever.

06:59.470 --> 07:03.190
You're just an incompetent tank 
who wastes his absorb shield.

07:08.550 --> 07:10.720
We know you're competent.

07:10.720 --> 07:12.340
Well, good luck.

07:18.660 --> 07:24.250
Sorry. You invited me to join your party, 
but I guess I wasn't strong enough.

07:24.250 --> 07:25.790
That's not true!

07:26.210 --> 07:29.600
Rud, is this really goodbye?

07:30.690 --> 07:35.520
Remember how I told you about 
the town my sister and I lived in?

07:35.520 --> 07:38.720
Avancia, right? What about it?

07:39.430 --> 07:41.190
Come visit sometime.

07:41.790 --> 07:47.730
I won't always be in, but from now on,
 I'm going to live there with my sister.

07:47.730 --> 07:50.490
So we'll meet again someday.

07:51.940 --> 07:53.030
Okay.

07:53.620 --> 07:57.030
Well, it's not like I'll miss you
 or anything, you know.

07:58.420 --> 07:59.620
I know.

08:00.180 --> 08:02.860
I look forward to the day we meet again.

08:07.460 --> 08:10.360
Now, what should I do?

08:10.360 --> 08:12.010
I can't go back to Avancia quite yet.

08:12.640 --> 08:16.300
You're just an incompetent tank 
who wastes his absorb shield.

08:16.820 --> 08:21.440
<i>Is Kyglas right about my skills chiping away at
my absorb shield without me realizing it?</i>

08:21.440 --> 08:23.850
<i>That would be a terrible skill to have.</i>

08:24.310 --> 08:27.390
<i>That said, I can't rely on 
anyone's Identify skill right now.</i>

08:28.770 --> 08:33.200
Still, are we <i>sure</i> we can handle
 this escort job with just us?

08:33.200 --> 08:35.780
We've been promoted to D-rank. We'll be fine.

08:36.260 --> 08:39.740
Yeah. We can probably make it to Kurass.

08:40.300 --> 08:42.800
Yeah, but...

08:42.160 --> 08:43.750
m 466 105 l 521 82 573 104 573 118 516 134 466 120

08:42.160 --> 08:43.750
<b>Kurass</b>

08:42.160 --> 08:43.750
m 395 143 l 397 170 467 169 466 142

08:42.160 --> 08:43.750
<b>Avancia</b>

08:42.160 --> 08:43.750
m 50 0 b 100 0 100 100 50 100 b 0 100 0 0 50 0

08:42.160 --> 08:43.750
<b>Current
Location</b>

08:45.070 --> 08:46.360
You guys got a minute?

08:47.290 --> 08:48.210
He's huge!

08:48.210 --> 08:51.250
Would you let me join you on that job?

08:51.250 --> 08:53.260
Oh, you don't need to pay me.

08:53.680 --> 08:56.180
Uh, what's your adventurer rank?

08:56.180 --> 08:56.720
Huh?

08:56.720 --> 08:57.550
<b>Adventurer Rank UP</b>

08:57.120 --> 09:02.680
<i>I'm actually F-rank since 
I spent all my time in labyrinths.</i>

09:02.950 --> 09:04.640
Stare...

09:05.270 --> 09:07.480
I've seen this guy before.

09:07.890 --> 09:09.080
I remember now!

09:09.080 --> 09:10.940
He was in the Hero's party!

09:12.020 --> 09:13.320
Please join us!

09:13.320 --> 09:14.750
Oh, but I...

09:14.750 --> 09:16.150
You there.

09:16.610 --> 09:19.370
You are the adventurers 
who agreed to escort me, yes?

09:19.370 --> 09:20.260
Yes, sir.

09:20.260 --> 09:21.790
We've gained a new member.

09:21.790 --> 09:22.910
What's your name?

09:22.910 --> 09:24.200
It's R-Rud.

09:24.520 --> 09:27.540
Mr. Rud, huh? Okay, that's fine.

09:27.540 --> 09:29.510
Your pay will remain the same, though.

09:31.570 --> 09:33.640
Now, let's go.

09:33.640 --> 09:35.100
Please do, sir.

09:36.700 --> 09:39.530
<i>I missed my chance to tell them my rank.</i>

09:39.530 --> 09:42.600
<i>I feel like I've tricked them, 
but I can't do anything now.</i>

09:43.070 --> 09:45.910
<i>I'll guard the wagon well 
until we reach Kurass.</i>

09:58.240 --> 09:59.990
A fog is rolling in.

10:00.510 --> 10:02.570
Shall we rest soon?

10:02.570 --> 10:05.310
No. We're nearly at Kurass, right?

10:05.310 --> 10:07.610
I have a bad feeling.

10:07.610 --> 10:09.210
We should head straight there.

10:09.210 --> 10:10.210
Very well.

10:10.830 --> 10:14.680
<i>As long as we watch out for ambushes,
 we should make it to Kurass safely.</i>

10:17.400 --> 10:18.130
Stop the wagon.

10:19.920 --> 10:21.440
What is it?

10:26.110 --> 10:26.980
Is it a monster?

10:27.360 --> 10:30.560
It could be bandits. Stay here.

10:37.970 --> 10:38.950
Hey, you.

10:49.390 --> 10:49.870
H-Hey.

10:58.360 --> 10:59.630
I don't sense anyone else nearby.

11:00.370 --> 11:01.610
It's not a trap.

11:02.710 --> 11:03.600
Are you all right?

11:06.770 --> 11:10.770
Don't be scared. I won't hurt you.

11:11.480 --> 11:12.410
Can you stand?

11:17.210 --> 11:18.670
Sh-She's naked?

11:20.010 --> 11:22.780
<i>A magic stone? Is this girl...</i>

11:24.820 --> 11:27.080
Mr. Rud, a monster!

11:29.970 --> 11:31.760
<i>A forest snake!</i>

11:35.360 --> 11:37.690
It's gigantic.

11:37.690 --> 11:38.920
Hide.

11:40.050 --> 11:44.300
E-Everyone, that monster's poison 
is deadly. Don't let it bite you.

11:44.300 --> 11:46.530
We can't beat that thing!

11:46.530 --> 11:48.740
Are we going to die here?

11:51.030 --> 11:53.230
Look at me, Forest Snake.

11:54.340 --> 11:55.360
Provoke.

12:06.170 --> 12:06.910
Mr. Rud!

12:07.280 --> 12:11.000
It's fine. I have a skill that 
protects me from all status effects.

12:11.330 --> 12:13.870
I'll draw its attention while you attack.

12:13.870 --> 12:15.850
Yeah, but...

12:15.850 --> 12:17.320
What should we do?

12:17.320 --> 12:18.170
<i>At this rate...</i>

12:31.790 --> 12:32.820
Manicia.

12:34.920 --> 12:36.270
Brother.

12:39.530 --> 12:42.390
<i>I can't let it end here.</i>

12:43.060 --> 12:43.740
You guys.

12:45.310 --> 12:46.950
I don't have a sword right now.

12:48.490 --> 12:50.740
You will have to cut it down.

12:52.110 --> 12:55.140
Grab your weapons and move your bodies.

12:56.210 --> 12:58.130
We have to work together!

13:03.080 --> 13:06.180
I swear that I, the strongest tank...

13:09.190 --> 13:10.760
will block all of its attacks.

13:11.260 --> 13:14.430
So trust in your own strength.

13:16.010 --> 13:18.190
I promise that you guys...

13:18.830 --> 13:19.870
will win!

13:22.710 --> 13:23.650
Now!

13:31.950 --> 13:32.620
That's...

13:33.030 --> 13:35.690
Everyone, it's preparing a killing blow!

13:37.310 --> 13:38.750
You have to dodge it!

13:39.260 --> 13:40.710
<i>I can't dodge this attack.</i>

13:42.120 --> 13:44.130
<i>If this is its killing blow...</i>

13:46.020 --> 13:48.050
<i>there's meaning in stopping it!</i>

13:54.670 --> 13:55.620
Now!

14:08.060 --> 14:11.410
I can't believe we defeated a forest snake.

14:11.410 --> 14:13.900
We couldn't have done it by ourselves.

14:13.900 --> 14:15.620
We beat it because of you, Mr. Rud.

14:15.980 --> 14:19.060
We beat it because 
each of us performed our roles.

14:19.060 --> 14:21.630
Anyway, could you carve up the monster?

14:21.630 --> 14:23.660
I'll go check on the girl.

14:24.920 --> 14:26.340
Got it.

14:28.830 --> 14:30.180
Are you uninjured?

14:30.180 --> 14:30.800
Yes.

14:32.000 --> 14:32.640
Good.

14:34.940 --> 14:37.300
You were running from that monster, right?

14:37.300 --> 14:38.760
What are you going to do now?

14:40.970 --> 14:42.400
Do you have someplace to go?

14:42.940 --> 14:46.200
I don't have anywhere to go.

14:46.200 --> 14:49.070
Then, do you want to come with me?

14:50.420 --> 14:53.630
I'm on my way to a town called Avancia.

14:54.340 --> 14:56.290
I can go there with you?

14:56.670 --> 14:57.870
If you don't mind.

14:59.460 --> 15:00.830
Of course I don't.

15:04.200 --> 15:05.060
All right.

15:05.680 --> 15:09.720
But you can't walk around dressed like that.

15:10.310 --> 15:12.550
You can have this, if you like.

15:12.960 --> 15:14.110
Are you sure?

15:14.110 --> 15:19.640
Of course. I'd be dead if it wasn't 
for you, Mr. Rud. Take this as thanks.

15:20.010 --> 15:21.570
Thank you.

15:21.570 --> 15:23.410
You can change over there.

15:23.410 --> 15:24.200
Okay.

15:25.850 --> 15:29.600
Is she an escaped slave, perhaps?

15:30.970 --> 15:33.540
<i>She's a homunculus.</i>

15:34.470 --> 15:39.610
<i>Homunculi serve humans as slaves, 
so they normally don't travel alone.</i>

15:40.140 --> 15:42.420
<i>Perhaps she's in some special circumstances.</i>

15:43.010 --> 15:46.410
It's hard to imagine slave traders 
would enter this dangerous forest.

15:46.410 --> 15:48.240
She wasn't wearing a collar, either.

15:49.590 --> 15:51.850
For now, I'll look after her.

15:56.120 --> 15:57.820
Thank you.

15:57.820 --> 16:00.000
Are you sure this is far enough?

16:00.000 --> 16:00.600
Yes.

16:01.270 --> 16:03.170
We'll be going now.

16:04.730 --> 16:05.950
Wait.

16:06.550 --> 16:09.920
Mr. Rud, are you in a party right now?

16:09.920 --> 16:11.400
No, not really.

16:11.740 --> 16:14.370
Then, will you join up with us?

16:14.370 --> 16:18.080
We'd like to adventure 
with a strong tank like you.

16:19.170 --> 16:23.210
I appreciate the offer, but I actually 
need to find the Secret Treasure.

16:23.720 --> 16:26.810
The one that's said to grant any wish?

16:26.810 --> 16:29.740
It also has the ability to create homunculi.

16:29.740 --> 16:30.670
Uh, yeah.

16:31.500 --> 16:33.090
Homunculi, huh?

16:33.090 --> 16:35.820
I don't really like homunculi.

16:35.820 --> 16:39.580
They're expressionless and do their work 
dispassionately. They're kind of scary.

16:39.580 --> 16:42.890
And only the magic stone on their chest
 visually distinguishes them from us.

16:42.890 --> 16:44.190
Yeah, but...

16:46.140 --> 16:50.900
Well, like I said, I can't go
 with you guys. Sorry.

16:51.390 --> 16:52.790
I see.

16:55.100 --> 16:59.010
I'm sure you'll conquer 
the labyrinth, Mr. Rud.

17:14.830 --> 17:17.640
Come to think of it, 
we haven't introduced ourselves yet.

17:18.070 --> 17:19.350
I'm Rud.

17:19.820 --> 17:21.880
Mr. Rud.

17:21.880 --> 17:23.150
What's your name?

17:26.730 --> 17:29.540
I don't have a name.

17:29.540 --> 17:30.650
Really?

17:31.950 --> 17:34.110
It'll be hard to refer to you without a name.

17:35.510 --> 17:37.660
<i>Lunafia petals...</i>

17:40.720 --> 17:41.470
Luna.

17:44.400 --> 17:46.410
Luna?

17:46.410 --> 17:49.460
If you don't like it, 
you can change it later.

17:50.060 --> 17:53.920
Oh, no. Thank you.

18:01.520 --> 18:03.100
Thank you for the meal.

18:03.530 --> 18:07.520
We should arrive in Avancia tomorrow. 
Let's get an early night.

18:07.520 --> 18:08.230
Okay.

18:29.550 --> 18:34.420
<i>As I suspected, Luna must be an
 illegally created homunculus.</i>

18:35.550 --> 18:39.840
<i>She has the will and emotions other
 homunculi lack. She can even fight.</i>

18:40.440 --> 18:44.310
<i>Normally, illegal homunculi are disposed of.</i>

18:44.990 --> 18:48.940
<i>But her frightened gaze 
reminded me of Manicia.</i>

18:48.940 --> 18:50.520
<i>I can't abandon her.</i>

18:51.120 --> 18:53.050
Oh, the pot! I'm sorry.

18:53.050 --> 18:55.360
It's fine. We already ate.

18:56.050 --> 19:00.190
Anyway, if you're <i>that</i> strong, 
couldn't you have defeated that forest snake?

19:00.190 --> 19:02.770
I-I'm skilled in magic.

19:02.770 --> 19:05.740
I don't have a single melee skill.

19:06.220 --> 19:11.090
<i>Magic? So she can imitate 
the effects of skills.</i>

19:11.090 --> 19:13.130
Do you have any magic skills?

19:13.560 --> 19:16.000
I have a skill that enhances magic.

19:16.000 --> 19:16.880
What else?

19:16.880 --> 19:19.340
I have one support skill.

19:19.770 --> 19:20.890
It's Identify.

19:20.890 --> 19:23.000
I see. Identify, huh?

19:25.630 --> 19:26.700
Identify?!

19:26.700 --> 19:27.520
Y-Yes.

19:27.970 --> 19:32.940
Identify is a very rare skill. Only one other 
person in the neighboring kingdom has it,

19:32.940 --> 19:35.150
but I heard they passed away
 a few years back.

19:36.330 --> 19:40.370
In other words, right now, you're the only 
person in the world with the Identify skill.

19:40.370 --> 19:43.740
I had no idea it was such a valuable skill.

19:44.200 --> 19:45.200
Luna.

19:45.730 --> 19:48.160
Could you identify my skills?

19:48.600 --> 19:50.370
Y-Yes, that's fine.

19:50.370 --> 19:51.470
You will?

19:51.470 --> 19:53.630
That was my job.

19:54.190 --> 19:58.660
I need to touch you to use my skill. Excuse me.

20:01.780 --> 20:04.050
Mr. Rud, you have four skills.

20:04.740 --> 20:09.490
Provoke: the ability to focus 
an enemy's attention on yourself.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.890
Next is Healthy Body.

20:11.890 --> 20:15.540
It makes you immune to status effects, 
boosts your natural healing,

20:15.540 --> 20:17.940
and makes your body as tough as possible.

20:17.940 --> 20:20.180
<i>I know about those two already.</i>

20:20.180 --> 20:22.120
<i>Now for what I'm really after.</i>

20:22.120 --> 20:23.950
Next is Life Conversion.

20:24.340 --> 20:25.800
Life Conversion?

20:25.800 --> 20:31.140
Life Conversion allows you to convert the
 absorb shield you've depleted into strength.

