21:05.280 --> 21:08.160
<i>So I was taking damage
 without realizing it,</i>

21:08.160 --> 21:12.830
<i>because I was using Shield of Sacrifice 
to protect my party members' shields?</i>

21:14.950 --> 21:16.040
What is it?

21:16.310 --> 21:20.500
I'd been worrying about 
my unknown skills for a long time.

21:21.480 --> 21:24.810
I never thought it'd be resolved this easily.

21:25.980 --> 21:27.790
Thanks, Luna.

21:27.790 --> 21:30.030
I'm glad I was useful.

21:35.840 --> 21:39.940
<i>I was kicked out of my party for 
having skills with unknown effects,</i>

21:40.360 --> 21:44.730
<i>but I had the ultimate skills 
for protecting my allies.</i>

21:45.700 --> 21:47.430
<i>I can return with my head held high...</i>

21:48.960 --> 21:51.360
<i>To Avancia, where my sister awaits.</i>
